+- `--threshold <metric>=<min>` – fail the CI job if a metric score is below the minimum (e.g., `--threshold exact_match=0.9`). Can be specified multiple times. Exit code 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass or no thresholds given. Reports always include threshold results.
 
